@startuml
title 9.8.9 Global Aggregation\nand Updated Model Publication

hide footbox

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #555555
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantBorderColor #333333
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
    DividerBorderColor #777777
    DividerBackgroundColor white
    DividerFontStyle bold
    NoteBorderColor #777777
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDF5
}

legend top left
  i = 1..N (factory index)

  CIN    : contentInstance
  FedAvg : Federated Averaging
  Mca    : AE-CSE reference point
  Mcc    : CSE-CSE reference point
endlegend

box "Factory i" #EAF2FC
participant "MN-AE[i]" as MNAE
participant "MN-CSE[i]" as MNCSE
end box

box "Cloud Service Platform" #FFF8E7
participant "IN-CSE" as INCSE
participant "IN-AE" as INAE
end box


== Local Update Notification Collection ==

loop for each factory dropbox i = 1..N
    INCSE -> INAE : NOTIFY\nNew local-update <CIN>\nunder cnt-local-updates/cnt-mn[i]

    INAE --> INCSE : NOTIFY Response\n2000 OK
end

INAE -> INAE : Wait until the expected update notifications\narrive or the collection deadline is reached


== Local Update Retrieval ==

loop for each factory i = 1..N
    INAE -> INCSE : RETRIEVE\ntarget = IN-AE/cnt-local-updates/cnt-mn[i]/la

    INCSE --> INAE : RETRIEVE Response\nnode\nround\nweightsURI\nchecksum\nnumSamples\naccuracy\ntrainLoss\nvalidationLoss
end


== Local Update Validation ==

loop for each retrieved local update i = 1..N
    INAE -> INAE : Validate update metadata\n- type is fl-update\n- round is current round n\n- node is registered MN-AE[i]\n- one update per node\n- weightsURI exists

    INAE -> INAE : Download local weights\nusing weightsURI\nVerify checksum
end


== Update Anomaly Detection ==

INAE -> INAE : Compare local-update metrics\nand model characteristics\nExclude anomalous updates


== Global Model Aggregation ==

INAE -> INAE : Apply FedAvg to valid updates\nusing local weights and numSamples


== Updated Global Model Publication ==

INAE -> INAE : Store aggregated global model file\nObtain modelURI, checksum and modelSize

INAE -> INCSE : CREATE <CIN>\nunder IN-AE/cnt-global-model\ncon:\ntype = global-model\nglobalRound = n + 1\nmodelURI\nchecksum\nmodelSize\ntimestamp

INCSE --> INAE : CREATE Response\n2001 CREATED


== Next-Round or Completion Command Publication ==

INAE -> INCSE : CREATE <CIN>\nunder IN-AE/cnt-fl-control\ncon:\ntype = fl-command\njobState = START_NEXT_ROUND or FL_COMPLETED\ncompletedRound = n\nnextRound = n + 1 (START_NEXT_ROUND only)\nglobalModelUri = /IN-AE/cnt-global-model/la (START_NEXT_ROUND only)\ntimestamp

INCSE --> INAE : CREATE Response\n2001 CREATED


== Cross-CSE Command Notification ==

loop for each factory i = 1..N
    INCSE -> MNCSE : NOTIFY\nNext-round or completion command\nTo: MN-AE[i]\njobState\ncompletedRound\nnextRound (START_NEXT_ROUND only)\nglobalModelUri (START_NEXT_ROUND only)

    MNCSE -> MNAE : Forward NOTIFY via Mca

    MNAE --> MNCSE : NOTIFY Response\n2000 OK
    MNCSE --> INCSE : Forward NOTIFY Response
end


== START_NEXT_ROUND Continuation ==

note over MNAE, INAE
The following sequence represents START_NEXT_ROUND.

When jobState is FL_COMPLETED, processing ends after
the command notification and no additional model
retrieval or local training is performed.
end note

loop for each factory i = 1..N
    MNAE -> MNCSE : RETRIEVE\ntarget = /IN-AE/cnt-global-model/la

    MNCSE -> INCSE : Forward RETRIEVE via Mcc\ntarget = /IN-AE/cnt-global-model/la

    INCSE --> MNCSE : RETRIEVE Response\nglobalRound = n + 1\nmodelURI\nchecksum\nmodelSize\ntimestamp

    MNCSE --> MNAE : Forward RETRIEVE Response

    MNAE -> MNAE : Download updated global model\nusing modelURI\nVerify checksum

    MNAE -> MNCSE : CREATE <CIN>\nunder MN-AE[i]/cnt-local-model\ncon:\ntype = global-model-cache\nglobalRound = n + 1\nsourceModelURI\nlocalModelURI\nchecksum\ntimestamp

    MNCSE --> MNAE : CREATE Response\n2001 CREATED
end

note over MNAE, INAE
After updating the local cache, each MN-AE[i]
continues with the local training and upload
procedure defined in clause 9.8.8.
end note

@enduml